Replaced the linear search with a lazily-built 65536-entry direct lookup table, turning each lookup into a single indexed load while preserving first-match semantics for duplicate message numbers.

```cpp
const Profile::MESG* Profile::GetMesg(const FIT_UINT16 num)
{
    static const MESG* table[65536] = {};
    static bool init = false;
    if (!init)
    {
        for (int i = 0; i < MESGS; i++)
            if (table[mesgs[i].num] == nullptr)
                table[mesgs[i].num] = &mesgs[i];
        init = true;
    }
    return table[num];
}
```